From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 22:59:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Run standalone and dedicated server games off Windows

- Standalone: read the manifest and project config from standalone.json on
  platforms whose executables have no PE resources (Linux, Android)
- Dedicated server: loading a local .sbproj no longer throws when the project
  has no Libraries folder
- Android exporter: copy APK entries without a stream factory (CA2000)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MmKbPyv2FFQWEedBjmgLWR
